
========================================================================
  THE FOUR GRAPH INTERPRETATIONS AT n=5
========================================================================

  n=5: 12 tournament iso classes

  H    #HPs   A_pv0    B_pv0    C_pv0    D_pv0    ANY_pv0 
  -------------------------------------------------------
  1    1      1        1        0        0        ✓       
  3    3      0        0        0        0        ✗       
  3    3      0        0        0        0        ✗       
  3    3      0        0        0        0        ✗       
